# Line endings are normalised to LF everywhere.
#
# The repository's index was already all-LF; what varied was the WORKING TREE, because a checkout on
# Windows with `core.autocrlf=true` converted to CRLF. That split cost real time: two gate tests
# failed locally and passed in CI, and the first diagnosis of one of them was "a pre-existing defect
# on master" — it was neither pre-existing nor a defect, it was the checkout.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` makes every checkout agree with CI and with every other machine, which matters
# more once development moves between a local machine and a cloud environment.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
